    "A massive fire struck a residential neighborhood in Tambora, West Jakarta, on Monday evening.",
    "The incident resulted in the destruction of 75 structures, including 35 houses and 40 rental units.",
    "Local reports confirm that 400 residents have been displaced and three individuals sustained injuries."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On the night of Monday, November 23, 2026, a significant fire broke out in a densely populated residential area within the Tambora district of West Jakarta. According to various news outlets, the fire severely impacted the community, resulting in the total loss of 75 buildings. This count includes 35 residential homes and 40 rental properties. Authorities have reported that at least three people were injured during the incident, and approximately 400 residents have been displaced by the destruction. Emergency response efforts were deployed to manage the situation and assist the affected population in the aftermath of the blaze. While other fire-related incidents were reported in different provinces, including Banten and Bekasi, this specific event in Tambora remains a primary focus due to the scale of the damage and the number of citizens directly impacted by the loss of their homes and shelters.",
